  effective: the date fully executed by both parties
  parties:
    seller: WALK THE LINE, LLC
    buyer: JAMES KELLY, or his assigns
  property:
    address: 301 Stillwater Road, Willernie, MN
    pin: 29.030.21.31.0084
    county: Washington

@center
  # Real Estate Purchase Agreement

THIS PURCHASE AGREEMENT ("Agreement") is made on {{date}} between 
{{parties.seller}} ("Seller") and {{parties.buyer}} ("Buyer").

## Recitals

Seller owns property located at {{property.address}}.
Buyer wishes to purchase the "Property" from Seller.

## Agreement

@1 Agreement of Sale.
Seller agrees to sell and Buyer agrees to purchase the Property, including:

@@a the building and all improvements (the "Improvements");
@@b all contracts and permits (the "Assumed Contracts");
@@c personal property per [[Exhibit B]] (the "Personal Property").

@2 Purchase Price.
The purchase price is ONE MILLION DOLLARS ($1,000,000), payable as follows:

@@2.1 Earnest money of TEN THOUSAND DOLLARS ($10,000) at signing.
@@2.2 Balance at Closing via wire transfer.

@3 Due Diligence.
Buyer shall have fifteen (15) days from the Effective Date to:

@@a inspect the Property;
@@b review all documents;
@@c approve environmental reports.

@4 Closing.
Closing shall occur on or before March 15, 2026.

@@a Seller shall deliver:
@@@i Warranty Deed;
@@@ii Bill of Sale;
@@@iii Settlement Statement.

@@b Buyer shall deliver:
@@@i Purchase price balance;
@@@ii Executed Settlement Statement;
@@@iii Proof of insurance.

@@c Title Company shall:
@@@i Record the Deed;
@@@ii Disburse funds:
@@@@A to Seller per settlement;
@@@@B to pay existing liens.

@5 Representations.

@@a **Seller represents:**
@@@i No litigation pending;
@@@ii No liens except disclosed;
@@@iii Has authority to sell.

@@b **Buyer represents:**
@@@i Has authority to execute;
@@@ii Has funds available.

@6 Miscellaneous.

@@a This Agreement shall be binding upon the parties and their successors.
@@b Time is of the essence.
@@c This Agreement constitutes the entire agreement between the parties.

